WEBVTT

00:02:57.642 --> 00:03:01.042
Three years later, I found out how wrong I was.

00:03:01.042 --> 00:03:03.642
But this time, I was the patient.

00:03:03.642 --> 00:03:07.473
Despite exercising three or four hours every single day,

00:03:07.473 --> 00:03:10.038
and following the food pyramid to the letter,

00:03:10.038 --> 00:03:12.195
I'd gained a lot of weight and developed something

00:03:12.195 --> 00:03:14.480
called metabolic syndrome.

00:03:14.480 --> 00:03:16.464
Some of you may have heard of this.

00:03:16.464 --> 00:03:19.909
I had become insulin-resistant.

00:03:19.909 --> 00:03:22.358
You can think of insulin as this master hormone

00:03:22.358 --> 00:03:26.421
that controls what our body does with the foods we eat,

00:03:26.421 --> 00:03:28.535
whether we burn it or store it.

00:03:28.535 --> 00:03:31.349
This is called fuel partitioning in the lingo.